            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw intumwa zijana ivyete bivuye ku mwami n’abaganwa biwe, zibikwiza mu Bgisirayeli hose no mu Buyuda, zivuga nk’uk’ umwami yashinze, ziti Yemwe Bisirayeli, ni mugaruke k’Uhoraho Imana ya Aburahamu na Isaka na Isirayeli, kugira ngo na we agaruke kuri mwebge abasigaye barokotse abami b’i Ashuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Kandi ntimuse na ba sogokuruza banyu, cank’ abandi b’i wanyu bāgenda bacumura k’Uhoraho Imana ya ba sekuruza, bigatuma ibatanga bakagesezwa, nk’uko namwe mubibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 32:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 17:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 29:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo None rero mweho ntimugamike amazosi nka ba sogokuruza banyu, ariko muyoboke Uhoraho, muze muze mu rusengero rwiwe yejeje gushitsa ibihe vyose, mube abasavyi b’Uhoraho Imana yanyu, kugira ng’ uburake bgiwe bg’inkazi bubaveko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
