        {
          "text": "Maz’ abaherezi, ari bo Balewi, barahaguruka, bahezagira abantu; ijwi ryabo ryumvikana ku Mana, ugusenga kwabo gushika ahēra hayo ah’ iba, ari ho mw ijuru.",
